{"id":"n78393-1-9","stage":1,"title":"집들이 · 乔迁宴","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78393-1-9-1","ko":"오늘 박 대리네서 집들이가 있대요.","zh":"听说今天在朴代理家要办乔迁派对呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"박","meaning":"朴（姓氏）","explanation":"박：朴（姓氏）","readings":[{"term":"박","audio":"/audio/a2ed2af4650eb11ce3b7.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"박","audio":"/audio/a2ed2af4650eb11ce3b7.mp3"}},{"text":"대리네서","meaning":"代理","explanation":"대리：代理；네：表示某人一家或所属群体，如 대리네（代理家）。；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"대리","audio":"/audio/4e96b696526850f76e08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48362","senseId":"2","lemma":"대리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대리네서","audio":"/audio/6826befcbc6fbb64e9e1.mp3"}},{"text":"집들이가","meaning":"乔迁宴，乔迁请客","explanation":"집들이：乔迁宴，乔迁请客；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"집들이","audio":"/audio/5bfb70ad490d439e6a00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78393","senseId":"1","lemma":"집들이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집들이가","audio":"/audio/d44218cbbf7c57a7f3ea.mp3"}},{"text":"있대요.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；대요：口语中礼貌地转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있대요","audio":"/audio/5d7bae9813de71887d28.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"4e96b696526850f7","term":"대리","zh":"代理","audio":"/audio/4e96b696526850f76e08.mp3","entryId":"48362","definition":"公司中一般职员与课长之间的职位；或位居该职位的人。","pronunciation":["대ː리"]},{"id":"5bfb70ad490d439e","term":"집들이","zh":"乔迁宴，乔迁请客","audio":"/audio/5bfb70ad490d439e6a00.mp3","entryId":"78393","definition":"搬家后，邀请亲朋好友到家里，请他们吃饭。","pronunciation":["집뜨리"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f6dc08b7afe82e2d1a34.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78393-1-9-2","ko":"아, 얼마 전에 이사를 했다더니 드디어 집을 공개하는군!","zh":"啊，之前听说他们刚搬了家，终于要公开新家啦！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"哦","explanation":"아：哦","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"4","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마","meaning":"不久（얼마 전：不久前）","explanation":"얼마：多少；얼마 전 表示距现在不久的以前。","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}},{"text":"전에","meaning":"以前","explanation":"전：以前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"1","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전에","audio":"/audio/2d406c50ea3b8c668815.mp3"}},{"text":"이사를","meaning":"搬家","explanation":"이사：搬家；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이사","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71138","senseId":"1","lemma":"이사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이사를","audio":"/audio/d48d115e5c076ef64d00.mp3"}},{"text":"했다더니","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다더니：引用以前听到的话，再说明后来的发现或结果。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했다더니","audio":"/audio/bed290d0afbb185fdf5f.mp3"}},{"text":"드디어","meaning":"终于，到底，总算","explanation":"드디어：终于，到底，总算","readings":[{"term":"드디어","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15026","senseId":"1","lemma":"드디어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드디어","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3"}},{"text":"집을","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집을","audio":"/audio/cd6aaeb8eea1e3b476ad.mp3"}},{"text":"공개하는군!","meaning":"公开","explanation":"공개하다：公开；는군：对新发现或刚得知的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"공개하다","audio":"/audio/c52b2418ba40ce28a552.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25446","senseId":"1","lemma":"공개하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공개하는군","audio":"/audio/36dfdf6fb01a0149f477.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"哦","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"由不知道而转向醒悟时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"不知道的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"以前","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17301","definition":"过去的某时。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"925efb171a8616cc","term":"이사","zh":"搬家","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3","entryId":"71138","definition":"离开原先生活的地方，搬去别的地方。","pronunciation":["이사"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"dfc77ad537b73519","term":"드디어","zh":"终于，到底，总算","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537